---
// A labeled example walkthrough (#190): how someone new to Morgantown who
// works from home could meet people in their first month. The person is made
// up; every step uses a real, sourced record from content/resources/.
// Pattern and rules: docs/playbook/example-walkthroughs.md.
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Route from '../../components/Route.astro';
import Milepost from '../../components/Milepost.astro';
import SourceLine from '../../components/SourceLine.astro';
import { resource, telHref } from '../../lib/content.mjs';
import { fixFormUrl } from '../../lib/group-requests.mjs';
export const page = { parent: '/meet-people/', label: 'Example: new in town and working from home' };
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const card = resource('mpls-library-card');
const wifi = resource('mympls-wifi-computers-and-rooms');
const programs = resource('mpls-adult-programs');
const nbhd = resource('morgantown-neighborhood-associations');
const firstWard = (nbhd?.meetings ?? []).find((m) => m.name.startsWith('First Ward'));
---
<Base title="Example: meeting people in your first month in Morgantown" description="A made-up example of how someone new to Morgantown who works from home could meet people in their first month: a free library card, working from the library, a free adult program, and a neighborhood association meeting.">
  <p class="example-tag"><strong>Example.</strong> This is a made-up person, not a real story. The places and programs are real, and each step shows its source.</p>
  <h1>Example: new in town, working from home, and wanting to meet people</h1>
  <p class="lede">Someone just moved to Morgantown's First Ward for a remote job. They know almost no one here. Here is what they could do in their first month, all free. Tap a step to open it.</p>

  <Route label="Steps in the example">
  {card && (
    <Milepost n={1} title="Get a free library card" when="Week 1" id="card" open>
      <p>{card.who_it_is_for}</p>
      {card.what_to_bring?.length > 0 && <p><strong>What to bring:</strong>{' '}{card.what_to_bring.join(' ')}.</p>}
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href={card.contact.url}><span>Library card page</span></a></div>
      <SourceLine sources={card.sources} org={card.org} about={card.title} slug={card.slug} />
    </Milepost>
  )}

  {wifi && (
    <Milepost n={2} title="Work from the library one afternoon" when="Week 1 or 2" id="work">
      <p>The library's Wi-Fi and quiet tables are free. Its computers are free too, for up to 60 minutes at a time. The main library is at {wifi.contact.place}. {wifi.hours}</p>
      <p>While there, they look at the library's calendar to see what is coming up (step 3).</p>
      <SourceLine sources={wifi.sources} org={wifi.org} about={wifi.title} slug={wifi.slug} />
    </Milepost>
  )}

  {programs && (
    <Milepost n={3} title="Pick one free program and go" when="Week 2" id="program">
      <p>{programs.who_it_is_for}</p>
      <p>{programs.what_to_do}</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href={programs.contact.url}><span>Library calendar</span></a></div>
      <SourceLine sources={programs.sources} org={programs.org} about={programs.title} slug={programs.slug} />
    </Milepost>
  )}

  {nbhd && !nbhd.hidden && firstWard && (
    <Milepost n={4} title="Go to a neighborhood association meeting" when="Week 3 or 4" id="neighborhood">
      <p>The city's page lists when nine of Morgantown's neighborhood associations meet. The city says the First Ward association meets on the {firstWard.when.replace(/\.$/, '').replace(/^Fourth/, 'fourth')}. The city says its calendar has the most up-to-date times and places, so they check it before going.</p>
      <p>Live somewhere else in the city? <a href={`${base}/meet-people/#neighborhoods`}>See when each association meets</a>.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href={nbhd.contact.url}><span>City neighborhood page</span></a></div>
      <SourceLine sources={nbhd.sources} org={nbhd.org} about={nbhd.title} slug={nbhd.slug} />
    </Milepost>
  )}

  <Milepost n={5} title="Look for what comes next" when="Next month" id="next">
    <p>After a few weeks, they could try a dinner or event at a <a href={`${base}/community-centers/`}>community center or hall</a>, help with a cleanup or a city board through <a href={`${base}/make-it-better/`}>Make it better</a>, or check what is coming up on <a href={`${base}/calendar/`}>Dates</a>.</p>
  </Milepost>
  </Route>

  <p>Rather start on your own? Everything above is on <a href={`${base}/meet-people/`}>Meet people and get a library card</a>. Questions about the library? Call {card && <a href={telHref(card.contact.phone)}>{card.contact.phone}</a>}.</p>

  <p class="meta">This example is made up. It is not a real person or a real case. Sources checked October 30, 2026. Something out of date? <a href={fixFormUrl({ page: Astro.url.pathname })}>Tell us</a>.</p>
</Base>

<style>
  .example-tag { border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; background: var(--accent-bg); color: var(--fg); }
</style>
